{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "ba1d65027e1a9af39a61d95d052c8229a39dd078b855c89b5b0e965a63b39f2b", "ja": "緊張と波乱の第二幕！", "zh": "紧张与波荡的第二幕！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c817f2737b74fbd76defdeac11cdee3ae436edb815917e78e4a493af0edd75ba", "ja": "第二幕の稽古をする夜想令嬢のメンバー。\n死体役が足りないと、手伝わされる\nプロデューサー。途中、役に感情移入して\n泣き出す恵美を、昴が心配してなぐさめる。\nリハーサルは順調に進む。", "zh": "夜想千金的成员们开始排练第二幕。\n因为演尸体的人手不够，于是制作人便下场帮忙。\n中途惠美因为把感情代入角色而哭了出来，\n昴担心地安慰她。\n排练进行得很顺利。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "58cce0a4cbb5e9b2c94732aaf55a627fbf2d6dd1a47f027402d004551e08e9cd", "ja": "さあ、今日は『昏き星、遠い月』第二幕の立ち稽古だ。\nみんな、準備はいいか？　それじゃ……スタート！", "zh": "好，今天是『昏暗之星，遥远之月』第二幕的走位排练。\n大家准备好了吗？那就……开始吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "757e6ff1ae7b503e406f8c555fcc145cc6797e6dfea8baba5a724ff22cf1df67", "ja": "この街は、腐った大人ばかりだ。貴族も、金持ちも、\n平民だって、子どもを使い捨てる……。", "zh": "这个镇上充满了腐败的大人。\n贵族、有钱人，甚至平民，都把小孩子利用完就抛弃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "2ad90e7aa25b9d7b615c1e4a20b26687d2792c2983f1033ed17e1d9d1b4cdca5", "ja": "だからオレはいつか、この街を出て、\n『約束の地』を探す旅に出るんだ。", "zh": "所以我总有一天要离开这个镇上，\n出发去寻找『约定之地』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "5af990ec1e026d98447fb691c21a056d8b99fade3fee17f8e16d1dd3dd24a7d8", "ja": "『約束の地』……？", "zh": "『约定之地』……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "9ef919b94be15ee15f867aea998d7a97739133320dbc4786c00e44defed77b2e", "ja": "ああ。昔、死んだ母さんが教えてくれたんだ。\nそこには、悪い人間は誰もいないんだって。", "zh": "嗯，是以前我过世的妈妈告诉我的。\n听说在那里，没有任何一个人是坏人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "18b4c358a2d931564f740d6035af96e93533d2a9bd23f4b19133181fa7ddc7f6", "ja": "オレが旅に出る時は……クリス。\nお前も一緒に連れていってやるよ。", "zh": "我出发的时候……克利丝。\n我也会带你一起走的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "7684779620dddb23efc3033dd486bd1685ab9ac5214eda2565508f5980c68be8", "ja": "……、……私は……。", "zh": "……嗯……我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "129db10fff39dbf2f48df01af0af772a760e1b5bf4fb92d35319d19d9759d30f", "ja": "お前たち、こんなところで何をしている？", "zh": "你们在这里做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "638526936139727270e486721feabbab4428523c2ceb7ca4e7549cc2d5ab863a", "ja": "……貴方は……。", "zh": "……你是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "3cca8fa6fc64b1c2a0387f1e688c185b0c3a0596c99f81e675d10b90dcc01547", "ja": "……アンタ、誰だ？", "zh": "……你是谁？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1010_038chz", "source_sha256": "6d2cef301d661986210e6e25e9dcbab00d7baeed542c73eaade9794f3fa29863", "ja": "アレクサンドラ。……辺境伯夫人より命を受けた、\nヴァンパイアハンターだ。", "zh": "我是亚历山大。\n……是藩侯夫人任命的吸血鬼猎人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1011_038chz", "source_sha256": "651709240e153a9717ffa10cb47192acbc67a016547d2ff927035d3f0779dd11", "ja": "お前たち、この地区は危険だ。\nヴァンパイアが潜んでいる。", "zh": "你们两个，这个地区很危险。\n有吸血鬼躲在这里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "1843ec60b0c4e50bebd5656570a231814b6c55e6fb2cafb2a3e010feed5fb79b", "ja": "ヴァンパイアが？\n……行こう、クリス。", "zh": "有吸血鬼？\n……走吧，克利丝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "0274ea71dc3ebcaa41ac5592c721349222d20a8e597492e611d059248f8aef50", "ja": "……ええ。", "zh": "……嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1014_038chz", "source_sha256": "10c20e07e3842d7f7e835fbcf0104ff2bce0e67445913589c9bc6d2d3fc2bd06", "ja": "もし、ノエルが……妹が成長していれば……\nあれぐらいの少女だったのだろうか……。", "zh": "如果诺艾儿……我妹妹有长大的话……\n应该也已经是那个年纪的少女了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1015_038chz", "source_sha256": "4c4e334a46b12895b53706a9c1105d2a71f6cb5c0661b4ae3077f59308f5176d", "ja": "……考えるな、今は。\n私の役目は、ヴァンパイアを狩る事。それだけだ……。", "zh": "……现在先别想了。\n我的任务是狩猎吸血鬼，仅此而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1016_038chz", "source_sha256": "212116b3122f3b6ca09257d17983b559caf11961910f527a3392c8e4ed68c591", "ja": "ふぅ。皮膚がピリピリするようなプレッシャーを、\n演技の間中、朋花から感じていましたわ……。", "zh": "呼，感受到一股让皮肤刺痛的压迫感，\n从朋花的演绎中散发出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1017_031tom", "source_sha256": "e40ae0c36bc798243043f1b8d9961c89f7eee3b00c7767cd001547370c96e097", "ja": "うふふ、そうですね～。アレクサンドラは\nクリスの敵、ヴァンパイアハンターですからね～♪", "zh": "呵呵，对呀～\n因为亚历山大是吸血鬼猎人，就是克利丝的敌人嘛～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1018_p", "source_sha256": "cf07d13b1b39a52e135d71ba76785d2ba28af96d0d5a81c44780aecffc608ed0", "ja": "だけど、そのおかげで、\n適度に緊張感のある場面になっていたな。", "zh": "不过也多亏这样，\n才为这个场景制造了适度的紧张感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1019_031tom", "source_sha256": "61bc6d0d056ac0cb121ae96259e6d09335d1c22d814dbb54603594101d336e3b", "ja": "必要なら、もっと\n強いプレッシャーを発することも出来ますよ～？", "zh": "如果有需要，\n我还可以发出更强烈的压迫感唷～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1020_038chz", "source_sha256": "e01b7ac25970d1ca9a036ed476958d10aa231970f37eaae7ae9d348d203ce2de", "ja": "いいえ。あれ以上敵意をむき出しにした演技だと、\nアレクサンドラが怪しむと思いますわ。", "zh": "不用啦，如果演得比刚刚还要更有敌意，\n会让亚历山大起疑的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1021_031tom", "source_sha256": "7d665c670f5c4577567c0f70c2fd1b165a9c5eff69a021d92905fba85eea8e04", "ja": "確かに、そうですね～。では本番でも、\n先ほどぐらいのプレッシャーを心がけましょう～♪", "zh": "的确是这样～正式上场的时候我会留意，\n就把压迫感控制在刚刚那种程度吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1022_047sub", "source_sha256": "1fe9ba75a440bd6aeeab14357af1972f377ff349d2936d636208269b22e705c6", "ja": "次、オレの出番だよね？　すっげ～楽しみだな～♪\n不良役、全力でがんばるよ！", "zh": "接下来轮到我出场了吧？我好兴奋喔～♪\n我会全力演好流氓的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1023_p", "source_sha256": "c85bfddf1a6323d221b5084d561ea85a477a87eb13be53ecd03a947bed21ff3f", "ja": "はは、ひたむきな不良になりそうだな。\n期待してるぞ、昴！", "zh": "哈哈，感觉会是一个热血的流氓呢。\n我很期待喔，昴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1024_047sub", "source_sha256": "df4ca4ad6f8b1d193886e9c94060419186d93abd18f2258c7266d908150a30c7", "ja": "へへへっ。カモが来やがった。\n綺麗な宝石とドレスじゃねえか。", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿，有肥羊上门了。\n你身上的宝石跟礼服很漂亮嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1025_047sub", "source_sha256": "58beab5367df8cd7f5725a318efa7a9d1256ac45692ab5b92c1733d728c1628e", "ja": "このナイフで殺した後で、\nゆっくり身ぐるみはいでやるよっ！", "zh": "看我用先这把刀宰了你，\n再慢慢扒光你身上的宝贝！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1026_020meg", "source_sha256": "7d601b6d4a70a1b302eda68a401c28457a0aaeeb24137fc27d87dba6c3b841e5", "ja": "クリス、危ないっ！", "zh": "克利丝，危险！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1027_047sub", "source_sha256": "b7855aeb0e68d80766b58a71f4abb738bce18ef50f77343a0e97fd2869256789", "ja": "なんだお前、ジャマすんな！", "zh": "你是谁啊？不要来搅局！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1028_020meg", "source_sha256": "47c8a318240c0b45910e9cc0e5310bd894139abb87f5fad240932919c6a15c56", "ja": "うわあっ！？", "zh": "唔哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1029_047sub", "source_sha256": "a0b015fedcb120bdf4d1cd40b8b4059338e58c21195b65d537c3f602b893e4d7", "ja": "なぁ、{$P$}。この場面って、\nふたりの不良がクリス達を襲うシーンだろ？", "zh": "欸，{$P$}。\n这个场景不是两名流氓袭击克利丝他们吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1030_047sub", "source_sha256": "91bc06605fca0c829b731ac975b212bb86c9f8a74345d49213638648d392d0b9", "ja": "オレだけじゃ死体が足りないから、\n{$P$}も死体役になってよ！", "zh": "只有我的话尸体人数不够，\n{$P$}也来演尸体吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1031_p", "source_sha256": "e7497757d72b0166300d45a72e6b69b4757a4a6cfc49e698fa102386f92754ca", "ja": "お、俺もか！？　仕方ないな……。", "zh": "我、我也要下场吗！？这也没办法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1032_se", "source_sha256": "7b97220ffd8e5e4fedf595a3ec16d00ff1e962c4df3c6dc45ef7d84facf9217e", "ja": "（ピタッ）", "zh": "（躺下）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1033_p", "source_sha256": "8cf1459729214de548924a3a315a507ef9f4710300423135520fcba8741da13a", "ja": "床、結構冷たいな……。\n……じゃあ、リハーサル続けてくれ。", "zh": "地板还挺冷的耶……\n……那么，继续排练吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1034_020meg", "source_sha256": "25c09d7d381a88b5175b737b82d4f7c570abbd59c71cedf56f44e7876fa99313", "ja": "……はぁ、はぁ、はぁ……。\nうっ……ゴホッ、ゴホッ……。", "zh": "……呼、呼、呼……\n呜……咳、咳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1035_031tom", "source_sha256": "d7bc3d0a453b947527801e86b88d5d30c08e17da60825f7ad1606c5f8c6a027a", "ja": "良かった、エドガー……。\n貴方が目覚めなかったら、私は……。", "zh": "太好了，艾德嘉……\n如果你没有醒来，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1036_020meg", "source_sha256": "b1f3037d850f9dfa442a06b808a8e430e5fd997901aacc5c9607107cba141a77", "ja": "クリス……キミは……。", "zh": "克利丝……你是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1037_031tom", "source_sha256": "36e23962928627a9a074bb8ccaf4c892e3b13bbcd4edda69841f3ccf8dfe2cb3", "ja": "エドガー、選んでください。ここで死ぬか……。\nもう二度と死ねない身体になるか。", "zh": "艾德嘉，请你选择吧。\n你要现在死去……还是要成为不死之身。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1038_031tom", "source_sha256": "5c395f7fd701fd4cdc0e4fd0534e0bce92ab9dbef2a5ebdc33d6f21b73f1cc5b", "ja": "今ここで死ぬのと、もう二度と死ねないのと……\nどちらがいいですか……？", "zh": "现在死在这里，与成为不死之身……\n你想要哪一个呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1039_020meg", "source_sha256": "f25a855ecde9fd126af47c9ed267f6e0f522b5be976989c822c6b0a24cf13423", "ja": "お、オレは……。\nオレは……っ……！", "zh": "我、我……\n我……呜……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1040_p", "source_sha256": "8cc5d8df8ee294a659e9cbe12137a60055049028f491b8bd571436829fff88d2", "ja": "よし、ここまででいったん休憩にしよう。", "zh": "好，先到这边，大家休息一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1041_047sub", "source_sha256": "d333ae4474b8d542230ce33ad909194074190a1a262265b9f02623afa90f90e8", "ja": "おーい、恵美！　ちょっと休憩しようぜ！\n……って、あれ？　どうかしたのか？", "zh": "喂，惠美！休息一下吧！\n……咦？你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1042_020meg", "source_sha256": "6643f834d650b07cc26765397a5221477c8b10fe44cbbe48445c676f4c7702a7", "ja": "ひっく……。\nだって、エドガーがかわいそうで……。", "zh": "呜……\n我觉得艾德嘉好可怜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1043_047sub", "source_sha256": "c994d43fa5e4f705cb7fb18328955a2ac81d1e5f735d679037e280693368108e", "ja": "な、泣くなって～！　……そうだ。落ちこんだ時は\n体動かすのが一番だ！　キャッチボールしようぜ恵美！", "zh": "不、不要哭啦～！……对了，难过的时候运动是最好的！\n我们来玩传接球吧，惠美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1044_020meg", "source_sha256": "f1aab12f6b3de01a010a5dcad6f0110c7290a0c7a44f42eb0ba5a7e26f389fbd", "ja": "ううん、今はいい……。\nごめんね、昴……ひっく……。", "zh": "不，我现在不想玩……\n对不起，昴……呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1045_047sub", "source_sha256": "c3b4195adecaf160333e955321f29751b09b1ccb2fa15667f28c4bcd7f8a3da0", "ja": "えっと、それじゃあ……あっ、おやつ食べるか？\nなんでも付き合うからさ、泣くなよ恵美～！", "zh": "呃，那……啊，要不要吃点心？\n你想干嘛我都奉陪，所以你就别哭了嘛，惠美～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1046_p", "source_sha256": "cf7ec791c98f3d0141fdd27710037c0f62389848beb724fa0d508badfd4c7c39", "ja": "そっとしておこう、昴。こうして役と向き合う時間も\n大切だからな。大丈夫、すぐ落ち着くよ。", "zh": "昴，先让她静一静吧。现在这样面对角色的时刻，\n对她来说也很重要。放心吧，她很快就会冷静下来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1047_047sub", "source_sha256": "d51472dd908a351b39cf4ffeaa405ba91d373fbb11502c7e1388d497afa29bea", "ja": "そ、そうなのか……。うん、わかったよ\n{$P$}。そっとしておくよ……。", "zh": "是、是喔……嗯，我知道了，{$P$}。\n我让她一个人静一静……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1048_038chz", "source_sha256": "0fafc418e5bf2166c7b56f708d10db732af1144ac5c46427f302457736afdfff", "ja": "報告によると、近ごろ農場の鶏が襲われる被害が\n多発しているらしい……。", "zh": "根据报告指出，\n最近经常发生农场鸡只遇害的灾情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1049_038chz", "source_sha256": "9a23c7adecb3b6a451c6de9f31cdbd6585e04c9bdd6cfe3fabb505dc26bea9bc", "ja": "鶏は皆、血を抜かれて死んでいた。\n動物の仕業ではない。となれば……。", "zh": "那些鸡全部都是血被吸干而死。\n这并非动物所为。也就是说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1050_038chz", "source_sha256": "440a783e9c566009627fb5a0078571c8a7d751f99e8337a6726e55f3722a485f", "ja": "次に襲われそうな農場は……ここか。", "zh": "下一个可能会受害的农场……就是这里吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1051_020meg", "source_sha256": "7eaa448021172dd1d97c1b03ca3aeb81ee11cbca722baa4da4306f66fafbc4ad", "ja": "人間を襲うのは、死んでもイヤだ……。", "zh": "我就算死，也不想去攻击人类……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1052_031tom", "source_sha256": "ee06ea5fec3464173be03e5b630f750b056e9e31b9af6eee571283d03e982367", "ja": "ええ、わかっています。だからこうして、\n鶏の血で渇きを癒しているのですから。", "zh": "嗯，我知道。\n所以我们才会像这样，用鸡血来止住饥渴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1053_031tom", "source_sha256": "b421f4994ec1e0ac4ad7832202baa4d145487970e618a2f4a2c05455f7e3e75e", "ja": "アナタが人を襲わないかぎり、\n私も、人の血を飲んだりはしません。", "zh": "只要你不攻击人类，\n我也就不会去喝人血。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1054_020meg", "source_sha256": "195c2903c8538038bbf188a8cd7e9d0c48f1e9e74c257c59a16da126d5e90b2a", "ja": "ありがとう……。\nけど……オレは、農場を襲うのも……。", "zh": "谢谢你……\n不过……我也不想袭击农场……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1055_031tom", "source_sha256": "06fe926fdf357759af31c90cf133633bb900a5eb501ab9ad6992978388e24cfd", "ja": "……ですが……\nこのままでは死んでしまいますよ、エドガー。", "zh": "……但是……\n这样下去你会死的，艾德嘉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1056_020meg", "source_sha256": "c0792f47babdc3fb5c437cfe2e2c6e13dc27e0d76176dc06db14c29dec106305", "ja": "良いことを考えたんだよ、クリス。\nここじゃない、ずっと遠いどこかへ行こう。", "zh": "我想到一个好主意了，克利丝。\n我们离开这里，到很远的地方去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1057_020meg", "source_sha256": "f44bd5d5b8b307b6d277dafcaa46b023f6aec33df2c8f412e64c1c42ccb658f1", "ja": "悪い人間のいない『約束の地』へさ。\nきっとそこなら、オレ達だって幸せに暮らせる……。", "zh": "我们去没有坏人的『约定之地』吧。\n只要去了那里，我们一定也能过着幸福的生活……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1058_031tom", "source_sha256": "2ead0f3fa24074d0a3fe7e60c76bb24e51603bd24981d9a285c55b08c31e1a80", "ja": "……行けません。私には、罪があるから……。\n共に旅に出れば、アナタまで命を狙われるでしょう。", "zh": "……我不能去，因为我犯了罪……\n如果我们一起旅行，连你也会被追杀的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1059_020meg", "source_sha256": "61cbd98cbb90cf68d49880239528d2bb44c62e01456e995a073b1663046f34b4", "ja": "命を狙われることなんて、怖くない！\nオレは……オレは、クリスと一緒にいたいんだ！", "zh": "我才不怕被追杀！\n我……我想和克利丝在一起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1060_031tom", "source_sha256": "681d630e75dadea72325c4d4c0133f21c0436d09071b25fbbb54047e29dc63f1", "ja": "エドガー……。", "zh": "艾德嘉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1061_038chz", "source_sha256": "d20347574d4652be785bbc3ed3ada4669efcfe3aa33efcf7e7dfe6af836268d0", "ja": "思惑通りだ。待っていたぞ、ヴァンパイア。", "zh": "果然不出我所料。我等你们很久了，吸血鬼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1062_020meg", "source_sha256": "430431932c0280c5ed15f2af30e7a36a7e2030214e58c349f06bc941ba6468a9", "ja": "……誰だ！？", "zh": "……你是谁！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1063_038chz", "source_sha256": "13c5118ba9759e54c1544c9a5528588894e13471acf0d0597c2776f9e9115cc8", "ja": "……なに？　お前たちは、あの時の……？", "zh": "……什么？你们是那时候的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1064_038chz", "source_sha256": "55e405faee4678635a9cdb92aa8a8bc6bc4d36a6e9349612430a68c26dda5541", "ja": "そんな、まだ子どもでは……いや、考えるな……！\nノエルのために……無辜の民を守るために！", "zh": "怎么这样，你们不还是小孩吗……不行，不要想了……！\n这是为了诺艾儿……为了保护无辜的人民！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1065_038chz", "source_sha256": "cfd1708c27e377d7b1aaa5615bcfe71b2af7f3266e890891c6608ae208c5fd51", "ja": "私は……この剣を執る！", "zh": "我要……举起这把剑！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1066_031tom", "source_sha256": "cca4fb921ddb6886f514d55e62cfbf3ec3bcc96fe6b85a21bd67df85424a2cc4", "ja": "皆さん、熱の入った演技でしたね～♪\n登場人物達の苦悩が伝わってきました～。", "zh": "大家的演技都好逼真唷～♪\n可以感受到登场人物们的内心纠葛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_04_1067_p", "source_sha256": "54b7d118160bac603c225caa463dc4d9c8f235c07317ebf3d33294fd592919a4", "ja": "ああ。ここまでのリハーサルは、とても順調だ。\n最後まで、この調子で行こう！", "zh": "对呀，目前为止的排练都很顺利。\n就照这个步调持续到最后吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
